    text "When Oriel starts" @388,206.68 #ece6d8 Space Grotesk 20
    text "Oriel opens as you left it: the tabs that were open, in their order, with the session that" @388,237.59813 #ece6d8 Inter 13.5
    text "was in front in front again, or the first tab when that one's gone. A session deleted" @388,256.93262 #ece6d8 Inter 13.5
    text "since is left out. The start view is for when no tabs are open: with tabs open, one is" @388,276.2671 #ece6d8 Inter 13.5
    text "always in front." @388,295.60156 #ece6d8 Inter 13.5
